  <artifactId>llmgw-persistence-sqlite</artifactId>
  <name>llmgw-persistence-sqlite</name>
  <description>SQLite-backed DatabaseContext (xerial sqlite-jdbc, WAL). A foundation
    pack: no Spring, Reactor or HTTP framework. Linked into the app explicitly;
